This repository holds ReSeed Quest, browser games about the ReSeed invention-convention project
(game code, text, characters, page design, voices, data files and the trained ForestNet weights)
("the Work").

You may play the games in a web browser and read the code on GitHub. No other licence is granted.
You may not copy, modify, adapt, redistribute, republish, mirror, sell, or otherwise use any part
of the Work, including to train or evaluate machine-learning models, without prior written
permission from the copyright holder. To ask, contact the author through https://github.com/khamydoan.

This repository is public so that GitHub Pages can serve the games. GitHub's Terms of Service let
GitHub users view and fork public repositories on GitHub; that grants no rights beyond those Terms.

Third-party components and data keep their own licences. Nothing above limits the rights those
licences give you in the original components:

- Fredoka and JetBrains Mono typefaces: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-*.txt)
- Satellite imagery in data/sites: contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data 2016-2026 (ESA) and
  Landsat data (USGS/NASA, public domain), accessed through Microsoft Planetary Computer
- Example pictures in data/examples: AI-generated (gpt-image) for the ReSeed project and labelled as such
- Voices in audio/voice: generated with gpt-audio-1.5 (Azure OpenAI) for this project
